  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 303.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 303.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 485:1, II(g) by establishing procedures and standards for the development and approval of new groundwater sources of water used in the production of bottled water.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at part heading for Env-Dw 303) #11059, eff 4-1-16",
